ext": "is", "start": 104.355, "end": 104.415}, {"i": 300, "text": "the", "start": 104.455, "end": 104.535}, {"i": 301, "text": "rest", "start": 104.595, "end": 104.775}, {"i": 302, "text": "of", "start": 104.815, "end": 104.855}, {"i": 303, "text": "your", "start": 104.895, "end": 105.015}, {"i": 304, "text": "day", "start": 105.055, "end": 105.235}, {"i": 305, "text": "looking", "start": 105.295, "end": 105.576}, {"i": 306, "text": "like?", "start": 105.616, "end": 105.856}, {"i": 307, "text": "Very", "start": 106.897, "end": 107.157}, {"i": 308, "text": "little,", "start": 107.217, "end": 107.457}, {"i": 309, "text": "now", "start": 107.697, "end": 107.797}, {"i": 310, "text": "that", "start": 107.837, "end": 107.938}, {"i": 311, "text": "you", "start": 107.958, "end": 108.058}, {"i": 312, "text": "have", "start": 108.098, "end": 108.198}, {"i": 313, "text": "given", "start": 108.218, "end": 108.458}, {"i": 314, "text": "me", "start": 108.478, "end": 108.578}, {"i": 315, "text": "permission.", "start": 108.638, "end": 109.078}, {"i": 316, "text": "Thank", "start": 109.699, "end": 109.919}, {"i": 317, "text": "you", "start": 109.959, "end": 110.119}, {"i": 318, "text": "and", "start": 110.36, "end": 110.44}, {"i": 319, "text": "goodbye.", "start": 110.46, "end": 110.84}], "segments": [{"start": 0.066, "end": 0.586, "text": "Good morning."}, {"start": 1.147, "end": 2.028, "text": "I am Gita Skoll."}, {"start": 2.868, "end": 3.969, "text": "I hope this is the right room."}, {"start": 4.73, "end": 5.05, "text": "It is."}, {"start": 5.791, "end": 8.513, "text": "I am Dr. Mogenson, and it is a pleasure to meet you."}, {"start": 9.034, "end": 10.075, "text": "Did you get here all right?"}, {"start": 10.835, "end": 11.416, "text": "Eventually."}, {"start": 12.016, "end": 16.54, "text": "They have dug up half the road by the roundabout, so it took twice as long as it should have."}, {"start": 17.901, "end": 20.043, "text": "They have been at that roundabout since spring."}, {"start": 20.684, "end": 22.125, "text": "So, what has brought you in?"}, {"start": 22.926, "end": 26.088, "text": "A cough that will not shift, and my throat is sore."}, {"start": 26.709, "end": 27.81, "text": "It has been dragging on."}, {"start": 28.67, "end": 30.031, "text": "Cough and a sore throat."}, {"start": 30.571, "end": 31.831, "text": "Have you had any fever with it?"}, {"start": 32.512, "end": 32.752, "text": "No."}, {"start": 33.352, "end": 36.694, "text": "No fever at all, which is partly why I hesitated to come."}, {"start": 37.434, "end": 38.414, "text": "You were right to come."}, {"start": 38.955, "end": 42.296, "text": "Let me examine you, and then I will tell you exactly what I find."}, {"start": 43.036, "end": 43.557, "text": "Please do."}, {"start": 44.337, "end": 48.559, "text": "You have no fever now either, and I find no signs of a bacterial infection."}, {"start": 49.279, "end": 51.1, "text": "May I ask what you are basing that on?"}, {"start": 51.72, "end": 54.181, "text": "I would like to understand it rather than just be told."}, {"start": 54.962, "end": 55.702, "text": "A fair question."}, {"start": 56.37, "end": 60.253, "text": "It rests on your temperature being normal and on what I found when I examined you."}, {"start": 60.893, "end": 63.095, "text": "Neither points towards a bacterial cause."}, {"start": 63.996, "end": 65.557, "text": "So what do you think it is instead?"}, {"start": 66.357, "end": 69.019, "text": "Most likely a viral infection of the upper airways."}, {"start": 69.62, "end": 72.201, "text": "That covers the nose and throat rather than the lungs."}, {"start": 73.102, "end": 73.743, "text": "Most likely."}, {"start": 74.463, "end": 76.084, "text": "How certain is that, honestly?"}, {"start": 76.885, "end": 79.086, "text": "I would call it probable rather than proven."}, {"start": 79.647, "end": 82.829, "text": "That is the honest word for it and it is the word I am putting down."}, {"start": 83.65, "end": 83.97, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 84.678, "end": 86.46, "text": "I appreciate you not dressing it up."}, {"start": 87.26, "end": 89.222, "text": "And no antibiotics, I take it?"}, {"start": 90.003, "end": 93.145, "text": "There is nothing pointing to a bacterial infection, so no."}, {"start": 93.726, "end": 97.449, "text": "What I recommend is supportive treatment, meaning plenty of fluids and rest."}, {"start": 97.889, "end": 99.09, "text": "Fluids and rest."}, {"start": 99.711, "end": 103.194, "text": "That is a very old-fashioned prescription, but I will try."}, {"start": 104.174, "end": 105.856, "text": "What is the rest of your day looking like?"}, {"start": 106.897, "end": 109.078, "text": "Very little, now that you have given me permission."}, {"start": 109.699, "end": 110.84, "text": "Thank you and goodbye."}], "machine": "gpu59.int.triton.aalto.fi", "git_commit": "735eed3a1a4f5d8bc8a3ac1f1c8897e291443b9f", "date": "2026-09-20", "timing_s": {"transcribe_and_align": 2.082}}